  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "服務行銷",
    "sub_ename": "MARKETING FOR SERVICE BUSINESS",
    "describe_ch": "此課程探討在營利和非營利組織之間服務的創造和傳遞中，行銷所扮演的角色。主要目標為在服務型企業和組織間建立一項可以評估、實行和管理有效行銷方案。此一課程提供學生行銷 如何在服務組織成功或失敗所扮演的關鍵因素等知識。",
    "describe_eh": "The course explores the role that marketing plays in the successful creation and delivery of services in both non-profit and profit settings.  The main objective of this course is to develop an ability to evaluate, implement and manage effective marketing programs in service companies and organizations.  Specially, the course will provide students with the knowledge of how marketing plays a key role in the success or failure of these service organizations.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能瞭解並說明服務行銷在管理層面的重要性及影響。",
      "describe_en": "Understand and be able to explain the importance and effects of service marketing to managements."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能辨識出服務行銷原理的應用及清楚的表達。",
      "describe_en": "Identify and make clear statement where service marketing principles can be applied."
    }
  ],
